<title>HUNGARY: TABLE-Hungary gas prices from July 1-Energy Off.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hungary gas prices from July 1-Energy Off.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the detailed gas price figures effective from July 1, as provided on Monday by the Hungarian Energy Office.</p>
<p> NATURAL GAS    Current price	Price from July 1   Change</p>
<p>		    HUF/cubic meter    HUF/cubic meter     in pct</p>
<p> Wholesale	   15.81		   17.95		+13.5</p>
<p> End-user(average) 20.96		   23.32		+11.3</p>
<p>  Household	  23.70		   26.04		 +9.9</p>
<p>Non-household</p>
<p>    (average)	18.85		   21.22		+12.5</p>
<p>   General purpose 20.20		   22.68		+12.3</p>
<p>Output price*</p>
<p>   (average)	 18.60		   20.98		+12.8</p>
<p>     gas price     16.01		   18.12		+13.2</p>
<p>     output fee** 320.00		  351.00		 +9.7</p>
<p>   Gas price only  16.01		   18.12		+13.2</p>
<p>Note: * - Prices for power plants, heating centrals;</p>
<p>	   ** - figures are in Forint/Megajoule/hour/year.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
